Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Result screen SPEC v2.1 (16:35 update): plain paper
 panel, tighter chest glow, softer badge glow
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Result panel 9-slice: its own SpriteFrame on the same texture with inset 212 (shared frame keeps 276 for the other
  popups), scaled so the border shows ≈ 23 pt; the centre is the asset's plain paper, no light/colour layer.
- Chest glow hugs the chest: r74 closed (centre 4 below the chest), r78 open (26 above), compact r50, never more than
  0.45 × chest width; peak α 47% (night 59%) closed, 59% open (≈ 55–65% of the previous strength), edge fades to 0.
- RewardBadge outer glow r40, peak α 43%.
- test_result_screen_style checks the panel inset/edge and the glow radius.
